      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Most values still round identically. Values near a midpoint can separate.\nIf those BF16 neighbors straddle an FP8 rounding boundary too,\nthe final query byte changes.",
      "originalText": "Most values still round identically. Values near a midpoint can separate.\nIf those BF16 neighbors straddle an FP8 rounding boundary too,\nthe final query byte changes.",
